      "description": "Reason code carried by an EXACT_UNRESOLVED response. The provider never emits a nearest-price or nearest-context substitution code; a coarse-key support borrowing raises COARSE_KEY_SUPPORT_LAUNDERING instead of emitting a response.",
      "enum": [
        "NO_ADMISSIBLE_POOLING_LEVEL",
